        <mxCell id="ZpQrJHny_sIRR5cqcIWl-62" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;The backing block share count may include referencing tables that are not resident.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Share count on dirty page may be &amp;gt;1 for file-backed pages.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Anonymous pages should have been split off during c-o-w, and so should have a page share count of 1. They may still share a backing block, though, which should get split off now.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;strokeColor=default;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 8;" parent="Q8lxBig8JVwoxU7zsYWM-11" vertex="1">
