        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="wyqYHZJBt5bBGCqyW8Ny-3" value="When splitting a page on c-o-w, we don&#39;t yet split the shared backing block. This is because if all other referencers abandon the shared block before we get evicted, we can continue to use it as if it weren&#39;t shared.&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;When this page is evicted, we will check if the backing block is still shared. At that point, if it is, we will get a new backing block for this dirty page and adjust the share count on the existing backing block.&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="140" y="430" width="245" height="180" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
